    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Interleave two sequences</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/merge-strings-alternately/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 1768</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Merge Strings Alternately</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Run one index up to max(n, m) and, in every round, append word1[i] then word2[i] if each exists: the longer word's tail falls out of the same loop. O(n + m) time, O(1) extra space besides the answer, built with a buffer, not repeated string +=.</p>\n"
